        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9c612c1d-1001-4bc3-b0c9-0d05b7ff6a92).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47. Your target is Ricky Macon, a gun merchant who is not interested in who is buying his stuff, as long as he gets paid well and his eyes and ears, Neeraj Rana. Mr.Rana&apos;s job is to look out for new customers for Mr.Macon&apos;s dirty weapon business. Our client is sure that they are just figures in a bigger game. Therefore he also wants us to recive some files, located in the Sheik&apos;s helicopter. Retrieve them so we can maybe find out what game we are playin here. Please be discret. Good luck.",
